  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As distance of the astronaut from the centre of the Earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, gravitational force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p>"
